---
import { evento } from '../data/contenido';
---

<section class="section section--crema alojamiento" id="alojamiento">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Alojamiento</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Dormís en el predio, <em>traé lo tuyo</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">
        El predio les proveerá cama y almohada. El resto del equipaje corre por tu cuenta, así que
        armá la valija con tiempo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="alo__grid">
      <!-- Provee -->
      <div class="provee reveal reveal--left">
        <div class="provee__head">
          <span class="provee__tag">El predio provee</span>
          <p class="provee__text">No hace falta traerlo.</p>
        </div>

        <ul class="provee__list">
          {evento.alojamiento.provee.map((item) => (
            <li>
              <span class="provee__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 18v-6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v6" /><path d="M3 18h18M5.5 10V7a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.5-1.5h10A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 18.5 7v3" /><path d="M7 18v2M17 18v2" /></svg>
              </span>
              <span>{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <div class="provee__note">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v2M12 19v2M5 12H3M21 12h-2M6.3 6.3 4.9 4.9M19.1 19.1l-1.4-1.4M6.3 17.7l-1.4 1.4M19.1 4.9l-1.4 1.4" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" /></svg>
          <p>Las noches en Pontevedra pueden refrescar: no te olvides la frazada.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Traer -->
      <div class="traer reveal reveal--right">
        <div class="traer__head">
          <span class="traer__tag">Traé en tu valija</span>
          <span class="traer__count">{String(evento.alojamiento.traer.length).padStart(2, '0')} ítems</span>
        </div>

        <ul class="traer__list">
          {evento.alojamiento.traer.map((item) => (
            <li>
              <span class="traer__box" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7" /></svg>
              </span>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <p class="traer__note">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5" /><path d="M12 11v5M12 7.8v.01" /></svg>
          ¿Dudas con el equipaje? Escribinos antes de viajar y te ayudamos.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .alo__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 1.6rem);
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  /* --- Provee --- */
  .provee {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 1.4rem;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.1rem);
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--musgo-2), var(--noche));
    color: var(--on-dark);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lift);
  }
  .provee__tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--sol);
    border: 1px solid rgba(234, 181, 77, 0.3);
    padding: 0.32rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .provee__text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--crema);
  }

  .provee__list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .provee__list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(157, 184, 154, 0.14);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--crema);
  }
  .provee__icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(234, 181, 77, 0.12);
    color: var(--sol);
  }
  .provee__icon svg {
    width: 19px;
    height: 19px;
  }

  .provee__note {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding-top: 1.2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(243, 240, 230, 0.12);
  }
  .provee__note svg {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 19px;
    height: 19px;
    color: var(--salvia);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .provee__note p {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--on-dark-soft);
  }

  /* --- Traer --- */
  .traer {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.1rem);
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    background: #fffdf7;
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 36, 26, 0.09);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  }
  .traer__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(16, 36, 26, 0.14);
  }
  .traer__tag {
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--verde);
  }
  .traer__count {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
  }

  .traer__list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.35rem 1.4rem;
    align-content: start;
  }
  .traer__list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(16, 36, 26, 0.06);
  }
  .traer__note {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    padding-top: 1.1rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed rgba(16, 36, 26, 0.14);
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
  }
  .traer__note svg {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    color: var(--verde);
  }
  .traer__box {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(44, 91, 60, 0.28);
    color: var(--verde);
    background: rgba(44, 91, 60, 0.05);
  }
  .traer__box svg {
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .alo__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .traer__list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
